{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在重慶一間動物幼兒園，四隻小獅子與一隻小金虎，開啟「求學」生涯。先來到草坪，在嬉戲中適應學校環境，再享用營養餐補充體力。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CQ.LION.MTV.0904-0914_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026OM3QtzQeDi1789350179.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CQ.LION.MTV.0904-0914_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:50.481085+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":60,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}